<section class="page-shell admin-shell"><div class="page-header"><span class="eyebrow">Safeguarding infrastructure</span><h1>Crisis contact directory</h1><p>Only operationally verified regional contacts should be activated in a production deployment. Demo placeholders are intentionally not real hotline numbers.</p></div>
  <div class="two-column"><form method="post" action="/admin/crisis-contacts" class="card form-stack sticky-card"><h2>Add verified contact</h2><label>Region<input name="region" required></label><label>Country code<input name="countryCode"></label><label>Service name<input name="name" required></label><label>Phone<input name="phone"></label><label>Website<input name="website"></label><label>Priority<input type="number" name="priority" value="100"></label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" name="verified"><span>Operationally verified</span></label><button class="button">Add contact</button></form><div class="list-stack"><% contacts.forEach(c=>{ %><article class="card list-row"><div><span class="tag"><%= c.region %></span><h2><%= c.name %></h2><p><%= c.phone || c.website || 'No contact route entered' %></p><small><%= c.verifiedAt?'Verified '+new Date(c.verifiedAt).toLocaleDateString():'NOT VERIFIED' %></small></div><form method="post" action="/admin/crisis-contacts/<%= c.id %>/delete"><button class="button button-danger button-sm">Delete</button></form></article><% }) %></div></div>
</section>
